+/* All functions return positive OpenBSD errno.  The pool owns its VA space;
+ * its kernel page table must outlive the pool.  Exclude new files and jobs
+ * before destroying it.  Destroy fails without freeing on outstanding refs
+ * or an unsafe unmap; collect retries failed unmaps. */
